    "narrative": "The **Austin Waves** enter today\u2019s slate with **Gunnar Henderson** headlining our roster as the premier start. With an elite efficiency score of 81.88, **Gunnar Henderson** benefits from a massive park factor boost (+16%) and a favorable matchup against Severino, whose 4.60 xERA provides a clear path to production. Similarly, **Kyle Tucker** (69.90) and **Jacob Wilson** (69.51) represent our most consistent options; **Jacob Wilson** specifically enjoys a significant park advantage, while **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.** (67.25) leverages a dynamic platoon edge against Alcantara that more than compensates for his negative BvP history. We are also looking for a potential ceiling game from **Jackson Merrill** (66.44), whose leadoff positioning and platoon advantage against Leahy provide excellent value for stolen base upside.\n\nOn the bench, **Nasim Nunez** was the most difficult exclusion, posting a score of 53.72. While **Nasim Nunez** offers high-upside speed\u2014bolstered by the slow delivery of Alcantara\u2014his placement in the 9-hole resulted in an 8% deduction that pushed him just behind the floor of our utility and outfield slots. We are monitoring **Heliot Ramos** closely; although his score is marginal (49.70), he receives a slight bump from wind conditions blowing out, though his matchup against Chandler remains a concern. Conversely, **Sam Antonacci** (46.73) faces a difficult test against Gilbert (3.09 xERA). While his elite xwOBA keeps him in the lineup, the significant negative SP skill factor represents a clear risk to his day. With **Luis Robert Jr.** remaining on the IL, our depth will be tested, but we remain confident that our core of **Gunnar Henderson**, **Kyle Tucker**, and **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.** provides the necessary leverage to win our categories today.",
